# On hex-next, a call's tasks open their steps in a sheet: from the agent line on the demo call (a pretend call),
# and from a task in a past call's transcript, over invented answers:
# ANSWERS=scripts/duo-call-tasks.json HEX=kept scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-call-tasks-taps
launch hexvoice:///?demo=call
wait 4
shoot call
tap Reading the layout notes
wait 2
shoot sheet-on-call
tap Checked the transcript beside Tasks
wait 1
shoot sheet-on-call-second-open
swipe-down Agents
wait 3
shoot sheet-closed-on-call
launch hexvoice:///?open=calls
wait 2
tap Router check
wait 2
shoot past-call
tap Signal lost at 6:02 pm
wait 2
shoot sheet-past-call
swipe-down Agents
wait 3
shoot sheet-closed-past-call
